     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I think you&#39;ll find some examples and exactly what you need using the very helpful raster tutorial here: <div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://neondataskills.org/R/Plot-Rasters-In-R/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://neondataskills.org/R/Plot-Rasters-In-R/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466898795000&amp;usg=AOvVaw33eYPoOs0BGVH2Qp9m0UQ4\">http://neondataskills.org/R/Plot-Rasters-In-R/</a><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>R</div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, May 23, 2017 at 7:24 AM, bic ton <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bict...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-fTN6gSkF8kw/WSRF2lx97hI/AAAAAAAAAAw/U_xIM7tymrgbxjBnO4SuC1Ose90n9kVfwCLcB/s1600/legend.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-fTN6gSkF8kw/WSRF2lx97hI/AAAAAAAAAAw/U_xIM7tymrgbxjBnO4SuC1Ose90n9kVfwCLcB/s1600/legend.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466898795000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2LdDWDFKJkjpg4NZnu9qXQ\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-fTN6gSkF8kw/WSRF2lx97hI/AAAAAAAAAAw/U_xIM7tymrgbxjBnO4SuC1Ose90n9kVfwCLcB/s320/legend.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"186\"></a></p><div>Dear all,</div><div><br></div><div>Is it possible to plot the attached map with such legend?</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Thank you so much for your help.</div><div><br></div><div>library(raster)</div><div>ra=raster(gmia_v5_aei_pct.asc)</div><div>plot(ra)</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks </div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div>Bic<